---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import clinic from '../data/clinic.json';

const effective = '13 October 2026';
const address = `${clinic.address.line1}, ${clinic.address.line2}, ${clinic.address.city}, ${clinic.address.state} ${clinic.address.postalCode}`;
---

<Base
  title={`Terms and Conditions | ${clinic.shortName}`}
  description={`The terms for using drtalalhomeo.in, the website of ${clinic.name}, including how its health information should and should not be used.`}
>
  <article class="article">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> Terms and conditions
      </div>

      <header class="article-head">
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span>Effective {effective}</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Terms and conditions</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The terms for using drtalalhomeo.in. The most important one: this website gives
          general information, not medical advice for you personally.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="article-body">
        <h2>About these terms</h2>
        <p>
          This website is run by {clinic.name}, {address}. By using the website you agree to
          these terms. If you do not agree with them, please do not use it.
        </p>

        <h2>General information, not medical advice</h2>
        <p>
          The pages and health notes on this website describe conditions and the clinic's
          approach in general terms. They are not a diagnosis, a prescription or a substitute
          for seeing a doctor, and reading them does not make you a patient of the clinic.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Do not start, stop or change any prescribed medicine because of something you read here.</li>
          <li>Do not delay or cancel treatment or surgery that a doctor has advised without discussing it with that doctor.</li>
          <li>If a symptom is severe, sudden or getting worse, go to a hospital or call emergency services. Do not wait for a reply from the clinic.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>No promise of results</h2>
        <p>
          Homoeopathic treatment is chosen for the individual, and people respond differently.
          Nothing on this website is a guarantee of a result or of how long treatment will take.
          The patient reviews shown are individual experiences shared publicly on Google, not a
          promise that yours will be the same.
        </p>

        <h2>Clinic details may change</h2>
        <p>
          We try to keep the consulting hours, the consultation fee ({clinic.consultationFee}
          at the time of writing), the address and the doctors' details up to date, but they can
          change without notice. Please call
          <a href={`tel:${clinic.phone.tel}`}>{clinic.phone.display}</a> to confirm before you
          travel.
        </p>

        <h2>Using the content</h2>
        <p>
          The text, photographs and design of this website belong to the clinic. You are welcome
          to read it, share links to it and quote short passages with a link back. Please do not
          republish whole pages or use the clinic's name, logo or doctors' photographs without
          our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Links to other services</h2>
        <p>
          The website links to services run by other companies, including WhatsApp, Google Maps,
          Instagram and Facebook. We do not control them and are not responsible for their
          content or for how they handle your information.
        </p>

        <h2>Our responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          We take care over what we publish, but the website is provided as it is, and we do not
          promise that it is complete, current or free of errors, or that it will always be
          available. To the extent the law allows, the clinic is not liable for loss or harm
          that comes from relying on the website instead of getting medical advice in person.
          Nothing in these terms limits the responsibility a doctor has to a patient under
          treatment at the clinic.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          How the website handles information is set out in our
          <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms. The version on this page, with the effective date at the
          top, is the one that applies. These terms are governed by the laws of India, and any
          dispute about them will be heard by the courts at Ernakulam, Kerala.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {clinic.name}, {address}. Phone
          <a href={`tel:${clinic.phone.tel}`}>{clinic.phone.display}</a>, or message us on
          <a href={clinic.links.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
